// Trillion-parameter LLM model manifest
//
// Architecture: MoE transformer with 64 experts
// - Context length: 4096 tokens (paged KV cache, 128 tokens/page)
// - Hidden size: 8192
// - Intermediate size (FFN): 28672
// - Attention heads: 64
// - Experts: 64 (2 active per token via top-2 routing)
// - Layers: 32
//
// Storage footprint at 8-bit (quint8):
// - Each parameter = 1 byte (packed 4-per-u32)
// - 1T params / 4 per u32 = 250M u32 values = ~926 GB full model
// - With sparse activation (2/64 experts): ~940M params active = ~940 MB
// - Paged KV cache (8 pages max, 128 tokens/page): ~16 MB
//
// Kernels:
// - ffn_expert_a/b: quantized FFN matmul per expert
// - attention_qkv/o: quantized QKV projection and output projection
// - moe_router: routing scores from input to 64 experts
// - kv_read: dequantize KV page for attention computation
// - kv_attention_scores: QK dot-product with KV cache

import "models/llama_trillion.naso";
import "models/attention_moe.naso";
import "models/kv_cache.naso";
